{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":16.88},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.08,"end":35.36},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.36,"end":49.04}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.28,"text":"有用的探索器能讓預測接受檢查。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.32,"end":6.88,"text":"最後的設定要呈現一個球面，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.2,"end":10,"text":"其偏離中心的切片半徑為 4。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.96,"end":12.64,"text":"比較正負切片高度，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.88,"end":14.56,"text":"並保留邊界案例，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":14.8,"end":16.88,"text":"作為以後修改時的檢查。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.08,"end":20.56,"text":"建立半徑 5、切片高度 3，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.84,"end":22.4,"text":"再改成 −3，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.72,"end":25.52,"text":"保存實驗參數。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.64,"end":26.8,"text":"測試高度 5，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":27.12,"end":30.48,"text":"說明為何一個點是合理的極限結果。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":32.48,"end":35.36,"text":"哪兩個高度產生相同大小的截面？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.36,"end":40.4,"text":"哪兩個高度產生相同大小的截面？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.16,"end":45.92,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":46.48,"end":49.04,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}